# Optional. URL of a PMTiles vector basemap (Protomaps schema): a full URL or a
# site-relative path such as /bengaluru.pmtiles (file in client/public). The
# pmtiles:// prefix is optional. Production builds already use .env.production.
# If unset in development, the map falls back to OSM raster tiles (dev only).
VITE_TILES_URL=
